# Faqat shu Dockerfile uchun (BuildKit ildizdagi .dockerignore o'rniga shuni oladi).
# Avval HAMMASINI chiqarib tashlaymiz, keyin kerakligini qaytaramiz — kontekst
# minimal bo'lsin va .NET manbalari, eski `wms-ui`/`legacy`, docs, uploads umuman yuborilmasin.
*
!frontend/
!docker/nginx/
!docker/web-config/

# frontend ichidagi og'ir/stendga xos narsalar:
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.angular/
frontend/.nx/
frontend/**/*.log
frontend/.husky/
# Ishchi runtime konfiguratsiya — stend'ga xos, image'ga kirmaydi (entrypoint yasaydi).
# Ikki yo'l: `@agentics/config` `assets/config/` ni o'qiydi, repo `.gitignore` esa
# hozircha `src/config/` ni yozgan — qaysi biri qolsa ham image'ga tushmasin.
frontend/apps/*/src/assets/config/app-config.json
frontend/apps/*/src/config/app-config.json
